* 12AX7 CC small-signal golden ngspice reference — B-source Koren twin of
* .model 12AX7 TUBE(MU=100 EX=1.4 KG1=1060 KP=600 KVB=300)
*   E1 = (Vpk/KP)*ln(1+exp(KP*(1/MU + Vgk/sqrt(KVB+Vpk^2))))
*   Ip = 2*E1^EX/KG1  for E1 > 0   -> 2*pwr(uramp(E1),EX)/KG1
* 10p Cgk/Cpk mirror DkKernel::from_mna parasitics. Grid current omitted:
* melange dc-op reports i_nl(grid)=0 A at Vgk=-1.2 V; the 40 mV drive keeps
* Vgk below -1.1 V throughout. DC OP cross-check: plate 170.1017 V both engines.
.OPTIONS INTERP reltol=1e-4
VMLG in_mlg 0 PWL({PWL})
RMLG in_mlg in 1
Rin in 0 1Meg
Cin in grid 100n
Rg grid 0 1Meg
BP plate cathode I=2*pwr(uramp((V(plate,cathode)/600)*ln(1+exp(600*(1/100+V(grid,cathode)/sqrt(300+V(plate,cathode)*V(plate,cathode)))))),1.4)/1060
Cgk grid cathode 10p
Cpk plate cathode 10p
Rk cathode 0 1.5k
Ck cathode 0 25u
Rp vcc plate 100k
Cout plate out 100n
Rout out 0 1Meg
Vcc vcc 0 DC 250
{TRAN}
.control
run
wrdata {DAT} v(out)
.endc
.END
